! pelog-approx.scl
!
! An illustrative pelog-like seven-note scale: small steps at the start and a
! large gap between the third and fourth notes. The cents are rounded and chosen
! for illustration. Real gamelans vary widely and this is not a measurement of any
! particular instrument; load a measured .scl for an authentic tuning.
! Pelog is usually played as five-note subsets (patet) of the seven.
!
